---
manual: element.every
lines: [1989, 1994]
testability: api
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $ticks = 0
  every(2) { $ticks += 1 }
end
----------- test code
advance(1.9)
assert_equal 0, $ticks, "nothing before two seconds are up"

advance(0.2)
assert_equal 1, $ticks, "the block runs once the two seconds are up"

advance(2)
assert_equal 2, $ticks, "and again two seconds later"

advance(4)
assert_equal 4, $ticks, "and every two seconds after that"
